ake... の awake。","category":"Unit4単語","type":"choice","choices":["目が覚めている、覚醒した","眠っている","正常な","乱れた"],"answer":"目が覚めている、覚醒した","acceptableAnswers":["目が覚めている、覚醒した"]},{"id":"english_comm-engc089","moduleId":"english_comm","prompt":"process information の意味は？","explanation":"Naps give your brain time to process information. の表現。","category":"Unit4単語・表現","type":"choice","choices":["情報を処理する","食事をする","郵便を配達する","動物を救助する"],"answer":"情報を処理する","acceptableAnswers":["情報を処理する"]},{"id":"english_comm-engc090","moduleId":"english_comm","prompt":"rest の意味は？","explanation":"after a short rest / rest your body の語。","category":"Unit4単語","type":"choice","choices":["休む、休ませる","乱す","提供する","発明する"],"answer":"休む、休ませる","acceptableAnswers":["休む、休ませる"]},{"id":"english_comm-engc091","moduleId":"english_comm","prompt":"disturb の意味は？","explanation":"disturb your sleep pattern の disturb。","category":"Unit4単語","type":"choice","choices":["〜を乱す、邪魔する","〜を減らす","〜に焦点を置く","〜を提供する"],"answer":"〜を乱す、邪魔する","acceptableAnswers":["〜を乱す、邪魔する"]},{"id":"english_comm-engc092","moduleId":"english_comm","prompt":"sleep pattern の意味は？","explanation":"late nap may disturb your sleep pattern。","category":"Unit4単語","type":"choice","choices":["睡眠パターン","昼寝の利点","郵便料金","申し込み締め切り"],"answer":"睡眠パターン","acceptableAnswers":["睡眠パターン"]},{"id":"english_comm-engc093","moduleId":"english_comm","prompt":"in the middle of the day の意味は？","explanation":"第1ルールで出る。","category":"Unit4単語・表現","type":"choice","choices":["昼の最中、真昼","午後の遅い時間","朝早く","夜中"],"answer":"昼の最中、真昼","acceptableAnswers":["昼の最中、真昼"]},{"id":"english_comm-engc094","moduleId":"english_comm","prompt":"alarm clock の意味は？","explanation":"第3ルールでセットすべきもの。","category":"Unit4単語","type":"choice","choices":["目覚まし時計","郵便切手","申込書","応急処置"],"answer":"目覚まし時計","acceptableAnswers":["目覚まし時計"]},{"id":"english_comm-engc095","moduleId":"english_comm","prompt":"oversleep の意味は？","explanation":"If you don’t use an alarm... oversleep. の語。","category":"Unit4単語","type":"choice","choices":["寝過ごす","眠くなる","覚醒する","